{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0393_1000_p", "source_sha256": "54e71153306f5ba423742d988321ef535adce3dec3dc59e7da57a6009ce338ab", "ja": "（まつりとこのみさんのラジオ番組が好評だ。\n今日も、たくさんのおたよりが届いている……）", "zh": "（茉莉和好美小姐主持的广播节目广受好评。\n今天也收到了许多听众来信……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0393_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a8b95c63c48fb4d9c8d196322cdb2c464d66aa65abcb97329a86600fe0abbc78", "ja": "ひとまず、感想と悩み相談の仕分けはこんなもんか。\n次の放送分は用意できたし、少し休憩でも……。", "zh": "总之，感想和烦恼咨询就先这样分好了。\n下一期节目的内容也准备好了，稍微休息一下吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0393_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "356fb1ab4bf0f5ac3963849409f90cf9179080c6216a4c4aaf2fd663cfb0e5d9", "ja": "はいほー！　{$P$}さん♪\n何かお悩みではありませんか？", "zh": "嗨哟！　{$P$}先生♪\n有什么烦恼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0393_1003_p", "source_sha256": "31983b10db4ed48584c0ea58cbe88ccf4f3db5566fa4eae781618f92d638b3eb", "ja": "お疲れさま、まつり。悩みごとのおたよりなら、\nここにたくさん届いてるけど……。", "zh": "辛苦了，玛茨莉。要说烦恼的来信，这里倒是收到了很多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0393_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "d9187e0c2caa0a3510aad1c12ac9af26169fd3f32b6682f0960a347eff6adf43", "ja": "むぅ……違うのです。姫は、\n{$P$}さんに聞いているのですよ？", "zh": "唔……不对哦。公主是在问\n{$P$}先生呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0393_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "11ac22076ba31171027585bd0be66e97b1c22b9ce02fd755c8e8fb202a845077", "ja": "では、もう一度……{$P$}さん？\n何かお悩みではありませんか？", "zh": "那么，再问一次……{$P$}先生？  \n您是不是有什么烦恼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0393_1006_p", "source_sha256": "03e5f1b4d184239711adb934d49f42d1e2d3448131dd5c02908c3a6443b6ee21", "ja": "（うっ……。これは何か話さないことには、\n解放してもらえなさそうだ……）", "zh": "（呜……不说点什么，看来是没法脱身了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0393_1007_p", "source_sha256": "21df395ddcba9c9cbb3ab17b3f86637bacb6f91398c6f03f480f3fdf1e51e153", "ja": "よ、よくわかったな！\n実は、とても大きな悩みがあるんだ……。", "zh": "真、真亏你能看出来啊！\n其实，我有个很大的烦恼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0393_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "8dc1163f837ce666bc317c4ab2d804fcbc76dd881078a2baa953dfed7e7f00c2", "ja": "はいほー！　それでは\n{$P$}さん、お悩みをどうぞ！", "zh": "嗨呼——！那么，{$P$}先生，请说说你的烦恼吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0393_1009_p", "source_sha256": "518da0e66b69ca2e39434255c8918fa6219c93c6c43f70cf0d1b399ad244e819", "ja": "そうだな……担当しているアイドルを、どうしたら\nトップアイドルにできるか悩んでるんだけど……。", "zh": "这个嘛……我正在烦恼，该怎样才能让自己负责的偶像成为顶尖偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0393_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "c8481adc1f6fb8cfcb8d5752220968a4be5d31758ff4cd6a33c5e963477d5fb4", "ja": "なるほどなるほど……\nちなみに、どんなアイドルなのです？", "zh": "原来如此，原来如此……\n顺便问一下，是怎样的偶像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0393_1011_p", "source_sha256": "7fe16e721a68e484e115dd6dcfead06a2a228ea5bcae017f6e359e033cc404dd", "ja": "え？　ええと……誰からも愛されるお姫様で、\nそれでいて繊細で、すごく優しいアイドルかな……？", "zh": "诶？呃……应该是那种深受大家喜爱的公主，同时又很细腻、非常温柔的偶像吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0393_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "73506e6d34bad61d4246e944846b99d9ba471c394af1c92ade72a252307bb0e4", "ja": "わ、わかったのです。{$P$}さんの\nお悩みは、姫がズバリ解決してあげるのです！", "zh": "明、明白了哦。{$P$}先生的烦恼，就由本公主一针见血地帮你解决吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0393_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "f3aafd3e5eb8fadb85f6b81ee20ba51fc295edd87d32514027e4577b82853ae3", "ja": "……姫には見えるのです。トップアイドルになって、\nキラキラと輝いている、その、お姫様の姿が。", "zh": "……本公主看得到哦。成为顶级偶像后，闪闪发光的那个公主的身影。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0393_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "9521171318c7ec4785601f0917e2c38a6d335d82838f7a1b8cda1b0e20f8e05b", "ja": "隣には、{$P$}さんも見えるのです。\nだから、大丈夫なのです！", "zh": "旁边还能看到{$P$}先生呢。所以，没关系的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0393_1015_p", "source_sha256": "93e9e63aea8955f7460374d22975e40e35a115ff61a7b3d6976639d8f22834a5", "ja": "そ、そうか。それを聞いて安心したよ。\nでも悩み相談というよりは、占いみたいだな……。", "zh": "这、这样啊。听你这么说我就放心了。\n不过与其说是在倾听烦恼，倒更像是在算命……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0393_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "725c3daf5c0665a8c3c85e85775cafd9226cba397cc7a2950a98aaa4390c8404", "ja": "ほ？　……とにかく、その素敵なアイドルには、\n{$P$}さんが必要なのです。", "zh": "哦？……总之，那位出色的偶像需要{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0393_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "9f977bd6d6c450007952251e2cdb821f52a03edbb8109f9eb47ad211ab3207a9", "ja": "だから{$P$}さんは、どんな時も、\nそのアイドルを信じてあげてほしいのです。", "zh": "所以，希望{$P$}先生无论何时，都能相信那位偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0393_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "e03b4166e8bd4c103d448d8df440b2e528285710312d20116a3bda9a48725930", "ja": "そうしたら、きっと。ね？　……ね？", "zh": "这样一来，一定就能做到。对吧？……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
